{
  "_comment": [
    "One morning of WHOOP v2 payloads: the cycle in progress, the one it closed,",
    "and the one before that. Field names, nesting and types follow the documented",
    "v2 shapes (floats for whole-number scores, milliseconds for stage durations, a",
    "null end and a null score on the open cycle, PENDING_SCORE until day strain",
    "settles). Each sleep's in-bed milliseconds equal its own end minus start, and",
    "its stage durations sum to that total, so the payload is internally consistent",
    "rather than only consistent with the assertions made about it.",
    "",
    "Hand-built to those shapes rather than captured from a live account, so unlike",
    "notion_page.json it is a faithful model of the payload and not a recording of",
    "one. The first two cycles are the real pair from the audit: 1664667247 opened",
    "2026-07-24 01:24 local carrying 7.5h at 79%, and 1644738825 closed at that",
    "same instant carrying yesterday's 14.2 strain. The third exists so a test that",
    "reorders the collection can tell 'newest completed' from 'first in the list'."
  ],
